"WHITE BLOOD CELL"

00:01:59.830 --> 00:02:01.580
Nyuuu!

00:02:01.580 --> 00:02:04.580
I wonder what's bugging those two.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:06.500
Nyuuu?

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:08.250
"EPISODE 6:
HARMFUL BACTERIA"

00:02:08.250 --> 00:02:10.000
"EPISODE 6:
HARMFUL BACTERIA"
"Harmful Bacteria."

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:11.920
"EPISODE 6:
HARMFUL BACTERIA"

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:21.380
U-Um, excuse me, how much farther?

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:23.210
Oh, right.

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:25.290
We're almost there. See?

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:31.670
This is the large intestine.

00:02:29.710 --> 00:02:31.670
"KEEP THE INTESTINE CLEAN"
This is the large intestine.

00:02:31.670 --> 00:02:32.580
"KEEP THE INTESTINE CLEAN"

00:02:32.580 --> 00:02:34.210
"KEEP THE INTESTINE CLEAN"
The large intestine.

00:02:34.210 --> 00:02:38.380
The organ that absorbs water
and minerals and produces feces.

00:02:38.380 --> 00:02:41.460
Where the final stage
of digestion is performed.

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:44.750
The large intestine is about
1.5 meters in length

00:02:44.750 --> 00:02:48.920
and can be divided into the cecum,
the colon and the rectum.

00:02:48.920 --> 00:02:50.830
It is said that several hundred
different species of bacteria,

00:02:50.830 --> 00:02:54.620
totaling one hundred trillion,
inhabit the large intestine.

00:02:56.210 --> 00:02:57.880
Not looking good.

00:02:57.880 --> 00:02:59.880
It's gone to ruin, all right.

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:03.120
"FRAGILE"
"CONDENSED GAS"

00:03:03.460 --> 00:03:06.380
Let's see.

00:03:06.380 --> 00:03:09.580
White Blood Cell! Ordinary Cell!

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:13.710
Thank you for your--
good work--I just happened--

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:15.580
--Are you okay?
--to be delivering--

00:03:16.540 --> 00:03:18.960
I-I can't breathe!

00:03:20.330 --> 00:03:24.670
This is toxic gas from the harmful
bacteria that live in the intestines.

00:03:24.670 --> 00:03:26.750
--"Toxic gas"?
--"Toxic gas"?

00:03:27.620 --> 00:03:34.040
The bacterial balance in the gut must be off,
and the harmful bacteria seem to be predominant.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.080
This is bound to cause some harmful effects.

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.460
Is that right?

00:03:37.460 --> 00:03:38.960
What a stink!

00:03:38.960 --> 00:03:41.790
I-I'm going to take care
of this delivery right now!

00:03:41.790 --> 00:03:43.290
You be careful, okay?

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:48.250
Let's see, this delivery's going to...

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:51.210
"WELCOME PROBIOTICS
IN THE LARGE INTESTINE"
Everyone, please look this way!

00:03:51.210 --> 00:03:52.960
"PLATELETS"
Okay!

00:03:56.920 --> 00:03:58.000
"TROLLEY STOP"

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:58.960
"TROLLEY STOP"
Roughly three types of bacteria
reside in the intestines.

00:03:58.960 --> 00:04:03.040
Roughly three types of bacteria
reside in the intestines.

00:04:03.040 --> 00:04:07.670
First, the good bacteria
that are beneficial to the body...

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:09.250
Good bacteria.

00:04:09.250 --> 00:04:12.830
Lactic acid bacterium, Lactobacillus gasseri,
Lactobacillus bifidus and the like

00:04:12.830 --> 00:04:18.960
work to boost immunity
and to stimulate intestinal activity.

00:04:18.960 --> 00:04:24.380
Next, the scary harmful bacteria
that wreak havoc on the body!

00:04:25.620 --> 00:04:27.330
Harmful bacteria.

00:04:27.330 --> 00:04:31.920
Pathogenic E. coli, Staphylococci,
Clostridium and the like

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:36.290
cause proteins to degrade
and produce toxic by-products.

00:04:36.290 --> 00:04:38.290
Wasn't that scary?

00:04:38.290 --> 00:04:40.330
Yeah!

00:04:40.330 --> 00:04:41.170
Last but not least,

00:04:41.170 --> 00:04:43.670
--Are you okay?
--neither good nor bad...

00:04:43.670 --> 00:04:45.790
Opportunistic pathogens!

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:47.710
Opportunistic pathogens.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:51.290
Bacteroides, non-pathogenic E. coli,
Eubacterium and the like

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:56.750
are all bacteria which do neither good nor harm.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:01.500
They ally themselves with whichever bacteria,
good or harmful, has the upper hand.

00:05:01.500 --> 00:05:04.830
Oh, so cute!

00:05:04.830 --> 00:05:07.120
Look how many of them there are!

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.750
That was fun, wasn't it?

00:05:09.750 --> 00:05:11.330
Do you think we can come back sometime?

00:05:11.330 --> 00:05:13.000
I hope so!

00:05:15.670 --> 00:05:18.040
Hey there!

00:05:18.040 --> 00:05:21.000
Oh! Big Sister Red Blood Cell!

00:05:21.000 --> 00:05:23.250
Hello, little Platelets!

00:05:23.250 --> 00:05:24.710
Hello!

00:05:24.710 --> 00:05:26.040
Are you touring this area?

00:05:26.040 --> 00:05:29.000
Yes! Oh! This way, this way!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:32.620
Go on! Take a look! It's really cute!

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:39.250
"THEATER ROOM"

00:05:39.250 --> 00:05:40.460
"THEATER ROOM"
The intestines are said to be home

00:05:40.460 --> 00:05:41.920
The intestines are said to be home

00:05:41.920 --> 00:05:44.960
to approximately a hundred
trillion bacteria in all.

00:05:44.960 --> 00:05:49.960
The body's health changes whenever
there's a shift in the balance between them.

00:05:49.960 --> 00:05:53.210
Oh really?

00:05:53.210 --> 00:05:56.540
Hey, so his friends are all here?

00:05:56.540 --> 00:05:57.880
Yeah.

00:05:57.880 --> 00:06:03.040
There are up to a hundred trillion bacteria
in the intestines, they say.

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:05.830
Wow! That many right here?

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:08.170
Then, we're sure to find them, right?

00:06:08.170 --> 00:06:09.460
Yeah.

00:06:09.460 --> 00:06:11.210
That'll be a relief.

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:15.250
He doesn't sound the least bit relieved.

00:06:15.250 --> 00:06:17.210
I wonder what's up with him.

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:19.080
Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:06:19.080 --> 00:06:21.620
Lactic Acid Bacterium, it won't be long now.

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:25.040
There are tons of your friends
right here, all right?

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:30.290
I bet you have some
awesome powers of your own!

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:31.670
Nyuuu!

00:06:31.670 --> 00:06:33.670
--Hey, you need to pipe down!
--Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:06:33.670 --> 00:06:35.790
--Hey! You don't want NK to catch on!
--Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:06:35.790 --> 00:06:38.040
She's eagle-eyed, you know!

00:06:38.040 --> 00:06:41.250
It's glaringly obvious, guys. So ridiculous!

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:45.460
Look, you two, I don't care what you do
as long as you're quiet.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:48.830
I don't want him to know we're on the move.

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:50.580
Attention!

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:52.500
Squad Leader, please be careful!

00:06:52.500 --> 00:06:55.710
We'll be close behind you
with the antigen presentation signal!

00:06:55.710 --> 00:06:56.710
All right!

00:06:56.710 --> 00:06:59.170
Now, I've fought with him once in the past.

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:04.290
And I'm going to use that experience today
to head to the front lines as a Memory T Cell

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:06.920
and finish off the enemy!

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.120
Memory T Cell.

00:07:09.120 --> 00:07:12.920
Some Killer T Cells turn into Memory T Cells

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:18.960
so that they can be ready to attack
in case the same enemy reappears.

00:07:18.960 --> 00:07:21.710
I'm sure you'll miss me,
but it's going to be okay!

00:07:21.710 --> 00:07:26.250
I'll still be looking out for you
even as a Memory T!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:30.040
Whether or not you'll be
up to the fight after losing me...

00:07:30.040 --> 00:07:33.420
Nothing worries me more
as your squad leader.

00:07:33.420 --> 00:07:35.830
After all, who else but me
has the inside track on his moves...

00:07:35.830 --> 00:07:38.120
--...and the ability to land
the decisive blow...
--The squad leader sure looks thrilled.

00:07:38.120 --> 00:07:41.170
--...and the ability to land
the decisive blow...
--He may be mistaking this for a promotion.

00:07:41.170 --> 00:07:44.920
But I swear on this cap
that I'll fulfill my mission.

00:07:44.920 --> 00:07:49.500
Though there's no guarantee that any of us
will be alive when we meet again.

00:07:49.500 --> 00:07:53.000
So, I'll be waiting for you all in hell!

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:55.000
Squad Leader!

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.500
Man, you're in my way.

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:03.210
Squad Leader!

00:08:03.210 --> 00:08:04.750
Killer T!

00:08:04.750 --> 00:08:08.790
Wh-What the... This abrupt,
uncalled for violence is--

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:12.330
Oh my, I'm really sorry. My foot slipped.

00:08:12.330 --> 00:08:14.040
NK!

00:08:14.040 --> 00:08:18.250
I was wondering what all you passive
grunt cells were doing, milling around here.

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:22.040
Is it a farewell bash?
Or maybe you're rehearsing for a play?

00:08:22.040 --> 00:08:23.920
How nonchalant!

00:08:23.920 --> 00:08:30.620
I'm not sure you even remember who the enemy
is now that you're so complacent, Memory T Cell.

00:08:30.620 --> 00:08:34.420
NK, what did I ever do to you?

00:08:34.420 --> 00:08:38.880
NK! Stop provoking Killer T
so that he'll regain his confidence!

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:40.830
Shut up!

00:08:40.830 --> 00:08:43.960
Neutrophil! Did I hear you call me "Killer T"?

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:46.000
Can't you see this cap of mine?

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:48.920
It's "Memory T" today!

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:50.920
--Memory...
--Memory...

00:08:54.170 --> 00:08:58.250
Hey! There you go again,
mellowing out with an ordinary cell!

00:08:58.250 --> 00:09:01.420
Keep that up and you won't even
be able to kill a lowly germ!

00:09:01.420 --> 00:09:03.380
Nyuuu!

00:09:03.380 --> 00:09:03.920
"Nyuuu"?

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:05.670
Th-That's not true!

00:09:05.670 --> 00:09:09.880
It may seem to be true,
but actually, it's not true at all!

00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:14.000
That's right! It's not true!
I'm a natural-born killing machine!

00:09:14.000 --> 00:09:16.080
And now, I'm off to prepare for battle!

00:09:16.080 --> 00:09:18.330
It's dangerous here,
so you should go somewhere safe!

00:09:18.330 --> 00:09:19.880
Yep, yep!

00:09:19.880 --> 00:09:23.750
Yeah! You'll only get in my way
when I battle that guy!

00:09:23.750 --> 00:09:23.960
Nyuuu!

00:09:23.960 --> 00:09:24.960
"NYUUU"
Nyuuu!

00:09:24.960 --> 00:09:26.790
"NYUUU"
I hear something crying.

00:09:26.790 --> 00:09:29.330
What are these guys, idiots?

00:09:29.330 --> 00:09:32.790
U-Um, I just have a simple question.

00:09:32.790 --> 00:09:36.580
Who's this guy you keep mentioning?

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:42.460
--A Cancer Cell.
--A Cancer Cell.

00:09:42.460 --> 00:09:45.210
C-Cancer Cell?

00:09:46.710 --> 00:09:51.620
A-A-An enemy like that at large...
I-I-Isn't that dangerous?

00:09:51.620 --> 00:09:53.170
Sure, it's dangerous.

00:09:53.170 --> 00:09:57.580
I've got to head out right away
to crush him. So, Cell boy...

00:09:57.580 --> 00:09:59.620
...we'll be going our separate ways now.

00:09:59.620 --> 00:10:01.170
Huh?

00:10:01.170 --> 00:10:04.120
It's time for me to get back to work.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:07.500
I'm sorry I can't accompany you to the end.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:11.670
Listen.

00:10:11.670 --> 00:10:16.250
If you go down this road and take a left, you'll
reach the tip of the intestinal epithelium.

00:10:16.250 --> 00:10:20.420
I'm sure you'll come into contact
with Lactic Acid Bacterium's friends there.

00:10:20.420 --> 00:10:23.670
So, return the little guy,
then leave the large intestine

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:27.000
and make your way back to the pharynx.

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:28.750
Okay.

00:10:28.750 --> 00:10:32.500
All right. Keep an eye on your surroundings
and watch your back.

00:10:32.500 --> 00:10:33.540
You can do it, right?

00:10:33.540 --> 00:10:34.750
Yeah.

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:36.620
Thanks!

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:39.380
Oh, hold up, White Blood Cell!

00:10:42.170 --> 00:10:45.170
Can you tell me one thing before you go?

00:10:45.170 --> 00:10:48.120
White Blood Cell, why did you protect us?

00:10:48.120 --> 00:10:50.000
After all...

00:10:51.830 --> 00:10:53.920
...you Immune Cells...

00:10:53.920 --> 00:10:56.330
If it's for the sake of the body,

00:10:56.330 --> 00:10:59.500
you kill bacteria and infected cells
who used to be your allies.

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:02.170
Killing them is your job, isn't it?

00:11:02.170 --> 00:11:03.750
So, how come?

00:11:06.460 --> 00:11:08.170
Nyuuu?

00:11:08.170 --> 00:11:09.420
Huh?

00:11:10.920 --> 00:11:14.540
Right. You're absolutely right.

00:11:14.540 --> 00:11:17.290
It's my job to kill.

00:11:18.960 --> 00:11:25.750
But... since all I ever do is kill...
Maybe that's why...

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:28.670
All right, see you!

00:11:28.670 --> 00:11:31.000
Make sure you send him off right!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:32.920
--Nyu-nyuuu! Nyu-nyuuu!

00:11:32.920 --> 00:11:34.670
--Right!
--Nyu-nyuuu! Nyu-nyuuu!

00:11:34.670 --> 00:11:37.170
Nyu-nyuuu!

00:11:40.620 --> 00:11:44.460
This slimy mucin will keep out
any invading bacteria.

00:11:44.460 --> 00:11:44.710
"GOBLET"

00:11:44.710 --> 00:11:45.040
"GOBLET"
Let's get them set up
so they don't get breached.

00:11:45.040 --> 00:11:45.670
"INTESTINAL BARRIER SEEDLINGS"
"GOBLET"
Let's get them set up
so they don't get breached.

00:11:45.670 --> 00:11:47.670
"GOBLET"
Let's get them set up
so they don't get breached.

00:11:47.670 --> 00:11:48.920
"GOBLET"

00:11:54.000 --> 00:11:55.210
That sounds close.

00:11:55.210 --> 00:11:56.580
Yeah.

00:11:56.580 --> 00:11:58.380
We'd better hurry!

00:12:00.080 --> 00:12:01.790
H-Here it comes!

00:12:06.540 --> 00:12:10.750
All right! The barrier's
holding up like a champ!

00:12:10.750 --> 00:12:13.120
You just can't beat mucin for durability.

00:12:13.120 --> 00:12:16.380
That was barely a blip on the radar, huh?

00:12:16.380 --> 00:12:17.620
Hold up!

00:12:19.790 --> 00:12:20.750
Oh no!

00:12:20.750 --> 00:12:22.330
There's more on the way!

00:12:22.330 --> 00:12:23.960
Let's get out of here!

00:12:28.960 --> 00:12:30.710
This way, this way!

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:39.330
Sorry!

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:42.540
There you go!

00:12:42.540 --> 00:12:44.420
Thanks, Big Sister!

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:46.040
I wanna ride piggyback!

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:46.920
Me, too!

00:12:46.920 --> 00:12:49.710
Me, too! Piggyback!

00:12:54.880 --> 00:12:57.040
Ouch!

00:13:01.330 --> 00:13:05.040
Um, you see, you see... Um...

00:13:05.040 --> 00:13:06.620
Um...

00:13:11.960 --> 00:13:18.170
Everyone! Big Sister Red Blood Cell doesn't
know what to do, so you all need to line up!

00:13:18.170 --> 00:13:20.120
Okay!

00:13:20.120 --> 00:13:23.250
You're all going to ride?

00:13:23.250 --> 00:13:24.920
Wh-What's that?

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:26.290
Whoa!

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:29.670
Excuse me! That section seems to be broken--

00:13:33.880 --> 00:13:35.580
Is that going to hold up?

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:38.790
Oh, please don't worry about it.
It happens all the time.

00:13:38.790 --> 00:13:40.210
Whaaat?

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:44.620
Lately, with the surge in harmful bacteria,
the intestines have been a mess!

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:46.960
We're totally at our wits' end!

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:49.880
I-I see that's it's been tough for you all.

00:13:51.920 --> 00:13:55.380
Um, go straight here...

00:13:55.380 --> 00:13:59.500
I hear there are tons of bacteria
on the other side of this wall.

00:13:59.500 --> 00:14:01.380
Nyuuu?

00:14:02.670 --> 00:14:04.500
It's almost time to say goodbye.

00:14:04.500 --> 00:14:06.040
Nyuuu!

00:14:06.040 --> 00:14:09.960
A lot of terrifying things happened,
but it sure was fun, Lactic Acid Bacterium!

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.420
Nyuuu!

00:14:13.830 --> 00:14:15.420
See...

00:14:15.420 --> 00:14:18.580
I never had anyone
to play with when I was a kid,

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.580
and I was bored out of my mind.

00:14:20.580 --> 00:14:23.120
I was really lonely.

00:14:23.120 --> 00:14:25.960
So, meeting you guys...

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:29.210
...and traveling all around
the body like this...

00:14:34.620 --> 00:14:36.920
It was such a blast!

00:14:36.920 --> 00:14:39.210
Nyuuu! Nyu-nyuuu!

00:14:39.210 --> 00:14:42.790
Nyuuu! Nyuuu! Nyuuu!

00:14:42.790 --> 00:14:45.290
I told you, it's no use!

00:14:46.620 --> 00:14:48.710
Nyuuu?

00:14:48.710 --> 00:14:49.710
No good!

00:14:49.710 --> 00:14:55.670
The bacteria's attack is too devastating, and
it's only a matter of time before they invade!

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:57.710
Goblet Cell.

00:14:57.710 --> 00:15:01.080
A mucous-secreting Immune Cell
that produces mucin.

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:06.710
Can also be found in the small intestine but
particularly abundant in the large intestine.

00:15:06.710 --> 00:15:09.880
Hang in there, Goblet Cell!

00:15:09.880 --> 00:15:12.120
Intestinal Epithelial Cell.

00:15:12.120 --> 00:15:15.080
Absorbs nutrients and water.

00:15:15.080 --> 00:15:23.170
Also builds mucous barriers to prevent excessive
immune responses toward Intestinal Cells.

00:15:23.170 --> 00:15:28.250
Do you know how many billions, trillions
of bacteria there are beyond this wall?

00:15:28.250 --> 00:15:30.120
It looks like they're in trouble.

00:15:30.120 --> 00:15:32.000
Nyuuu?

00:15:32.000 --> 00:15:33.790
Nyuuu!

00:15:33.790 --> 00:15:37.540
We Intestinal Epithelial Cells have to hold
them off with this intestinal barrier!

00:15:37.540 --> 00:15:41.380
Oh man! No way are we
getting there in time now!

00:15:41.380 --> 00:15:45.170
I mean it, it's futile! Come back here!

00:15:45.170 --> 00:15:47.790
--I-I'll help you!
--Don't give up!

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:50.670
"With burning hearts!
With a solid intestinal barrier!"

00:15:50.670 --> 00:15:54.420
Isn't that our motto? We have to keep
fighting until we reach our limit!

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:57.580
And I'm telling you, this is our limit!

00:15:59.540 --> 00:16:01.710
Nyuuu! Nyuuu...

00:16:01.710 --> 00:16:04.460
There goes all the mucin we planted!

00:16:05.580 --> 00:16:06.960
Huh?

00:16:12.420 --> 00:16:15.960
So, this is the other side of the intestinal
wall that we've been striving to reach?

00:16:15.960 --> 00:16:19.170
Now that we're here, it's nothing special.

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:21.080
Not a shred of style.

00:16:21.080 --> 00:16:26.500
Who cares? We're going to turn it
into an oasis for us harmful bacteria!

00:16:26.500 --> 00:16:28.750
Toward that end,

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:33.170
we're going to have to start
by eradicating all of the weeds!

00:16:36.670 --> 00:16:38.040
Come on!

00:16:44.420 --> 00:16:45.750
Wh-What's going on?

00:16:45.750 --> 00:16:48.420
Uh, it looks like there's some kind of problem.

00:16:48.420 --> 00:16:49.920
It happens all the time!

00:16:49.920 --> 00:16:52.170
H-H-H-Huh?

00:16:52.170 --> 00:16:56.000
These harmful bacteria sure are troublesome!

00:16:56.000 --> 00:16:58.710
Oh, you guys should all make a run for it, too!

00:16:58.710 --> 00:17:00.080
Whaaat?

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:03.460
Are you okay, Platelet?

00:17:03.460 --> 00:17:05.170
Yes! I'm fine!

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:08.500
--Better get out of here now!
--It seems like we've been invaded by bacteria!

00:17:10.170 --> 00:17:12.170
Everyone! Watch out, okay?

00:17:12.170 --> 00:17:14.960
I can't see in front of me!

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.830
The path's going to narrow from this point.

00:17:24.830 --> 00:17:27.620
All right, then I'll take the lead.

00:17:29.380 --> 00:17:33.330
Don't ram into me, you klutz.

00:17:35.120 --> 00:17:37.750
I didn't shove you that hard, you know.

00:17:37.750 --> 00:17:40.120
Are you that narrow-minded?

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:47.500
Damn you! Can you be
more unsteady on your feet?

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.380
Just go the cell home!
You're only going to get in my way!

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:53.710
Oh, that's rich! Right back atcha!
You bumped into me first!

00:17:53.710 --> 00:17:56.750
Oh yeah? Well, why are you tagging along,
you miserable loner?

00:17:56.750 --> 00:17:57.120
"THUNK"
Oh yeah? Well, why are you tagging along,
you miserable loner?

00:17:57.120 --> 00:18:00.500
"THUNK"
I'll take being a loner any day!
Better than your band of spineless fools!

00:18:00.500 --> 00:18:01.080
"BOOM"
I'll take being a loner any day!
Better than your band of spineless fools!

00:18:01.080 --> 00:18:03.710
"BOOM"
What did you say?
Didn't I tell you to stay away?

00:18:03.710 --> 00:18:04.000
"THUMP"
What did you say?
Didn't I tell you to stay away?

00:18:04.000 --> 00:18:06.250
"THUMP"
It was my long years of experience and intuition
that led me to determine that he was here!

00:18:06.250 --> 00:18:07.170
"RUMBLE"
It was my long years of experience and intuition
that led me to determine that he was here!

00:18:07.170 --> 00:18:08.500
"RUMBLE"
You're following me!

00:18:08.500 --> 00:18:09.420
"WHACK"
You're following me!

00:18:09.420 --> 00:18:10.000
"WHACK"
Hey, how about not clobbering
each other before the battle?

00:18:10.000 --> 00:18:11.250
"STAB"
Hey, how about not clobbering
each other before the battle?

00:18:11.250 --> 00:18:12.210
"SMACK"
Hey, how about not clobbering
each other before the battle?

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:13.420
"BANG"
Hey, how about not clobbering
each other before the battle?

00:18:14.460 --> 00:18:17.500
All right! We'll be reaching
the residential area soon!

00:18:17.500 --> 00:18:21.670
It'll be teeming with cells! It might be
unbearable for a social outcast like you!

00:18:21.670 --> 00:18:23.580
Killer T, you might want to stop talking now--

00:18:23.580 --> 00:18:25.460
Huh? "Killer T"?

00:18:25.460 --> 00:18:28.620
Call me "Memory T"! Don't you see this cap?

00:18:28.620 --> 00:18:30.670
All right, fine! Just be quiet!

00:18:30.670 --> 00:18:33.210
There's no telling where
the enemy might be lurking!

00:18:33.210 --> 00:18:35.210
He's right. Are you a moron or what?

00:18:35.210 --> 00:18:39.170
Why are you only telling me off? Not fair!

00:18:39.170 --> 00:18:40.380
Shush!

00:18:43.290 --> 00:18:46.540
It looks like he's meeting us head-on this time.

00:18:58.040 --> 00:18:59.250
Hey, NK!

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:00.670
Damn you!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.210
Where is he?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:15.380
NK!

00:19:15.380 --> 00:19:16.620
Go!

00:19:20.040 --> 00:19:24.460
You really came back to life just so you could
throw a tantrum, you stupid Cancer Cell?

00:19:24.460 --> 00:19:26.380
Die!

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:38.380
Did I get him?

00:19:39.620 --> 00:19:44.880
So, you fell for it!
He's nothing but a puppet!

00:19:44.880 --> 00:19:47.960
Look at all the effort you had
to put in against a mere doll.

00:19:47.960 --> 00:19:52.750
Do you know what you've gotten
yourselves into, Immune Cells?

00:19:52.750 --> 00:19:55.790
Where the heck is that voice coming from?

00:20:14.500 --> 00:20:16.420
I'm so thrilled!

00:20:16.420 --> 00:20:19.170
It's the trio from before, right?

00:20:22.380 --> 00:20:24.170
Cancer Cell!

00:20:25.170 --> 00:20:27.170
Cancer Cells.

00:20:27.170 --> 00:20:33.290
Cells that multiply uncontrollably
due to a genetic abnormality.

00:20:33.290 --> 00:20:40.380
They overstep the boundaries with neighboring
cells in a process called "Infiltration."

00:20:40.380 --> 00:20:42.880
It's been a long time, huh?

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:47.540
NK Cell...

00:20:49.170 --> 00:20:53.290
Killer T, now Memory T Cell...

00:20:54.710 --> 00:20:56.380
Lastly...

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:59.080
...Neutrophil...

00:20:59.080 --> 00:21:02.830
This just might be what they call fate, huh?

00:21:02.830 --> 00:21:06.710
For the three of you from that day
to saunter right toward me.

00:21:08.420 --> 00:21:14.210
Now then, which of us, me or you three,
is on the side of justice?

00:21:14.210 --> 00:21:16.620
Let's settle it once and for all.

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.290
Here he comes!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:25.080
Die! Die!

00:21:26.000 --> 00:21:27.380
NK!

00:23:36.960 --> 00:23:37.670
"NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW"

00:23:37.670 --> 00:23:39.170
"NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW"
I'll take care of the preview today!

00:23:39.170 --> 00:23:41.250
"NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW"
Outta my way! I'm doing it!

