"EPISODE 7:
CANCER CELL II (PART I)"
..."Cancer Cell II (Part I)"!

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:46.120
"EPISODE 7:
CANCER CELL II (PART I)"
Hey, butt out, will you?

00:23:46.120 --> 00:23:47.670
"EPISODE 7:
CANCER CELL II (PART I)"
Shut up, loner!

00:23:47.670 --> 00:23:49.460
"EPISODE 7:
